# Project Management Software

A simplified task and project management system with role-based access (Admin, Senior/Team Lead, Mid, Junior).

## Setup

1. Install XAMPP/WAMP (Apache, MySQL, PHP 7+).
2. Copy project to htdocs/project_management.
3. Start Apache/MySQL.
4. Run http://localhost/project_management/db/create_db.php to create DB and seed data.
5. Access http://localhost/project_management/ – login as admin@example.com / admin123.
6. For PHP built-in server: cd project_management; php -S localhost:8000 (update BASE_URL in config.php if needed).

## Features

- User auth (register pending approval, login, change pw).
- Admin panel: Manage users/projects.
- Projects: Details, team management (add/remove by Team Lead), mark done.
- Tasks: Create/assign/status change (with auto-comments), edit/delete.
- Comments: Add/edit/delete per permissions.

## Tech

- HTML/CSS/Bootstrap
- PHP OOP (MVC-like)
- jQuery AJAX for UI feedback
- MySQL

